.121569 .121569 .121569 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 40 Tm /F1 9.2 Tf 12.3 TL (Build an enterprise-ready AI knowledge copilot that allows employees to ask natural-language questions about organizational) Tj T* (documents and receive grounded, contextual answers. The system combines document ingestion, retrieval-augmented) Tj T* (generation \(RAG\), persistent conversation memory, safety controls, human approval for sensitive requests, and execution) Tj T* (observability.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
