q
1 0 0 1 45 573.6 cm
q
.121569 .121569 .121569 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 40 Tm /F1 9.2 Tf 12.3 TL (Organizational knowledge is scattered across policies, handbooks, procedures, and internal documents. Employees waste time) Tj T* -0.06835 Tw (searching for answers, responses can be inconsistent, and ordinary chatbots may hallucinate, lack access to current documents,) Tj T* 0 Tw (or provide insufficient controls for sensitive operations. Teams also need visibility into failures, response latency, and the steps) Tj T* (taken by AI workflows.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
BT /F2 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 45 561.6 Tm (3. Proposed Solution) Tj T* ET
q
1 0 0 1 45 487.1 cm
q
.121569 .121569 .121569 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 52.3 Tm /F1 9.2 Tf 12.3 TL (Enterprise-Knowledge-Assistant provides a single chat interface over approved enterprise documents. Files are uploaded to) Tj T* (Amazon S3, processed into searchable chunks, embedded with Amazon Bedrock Titan, and indexed in Pinecone. A LangGraph) Tj T* (workflow retrieves relevant context, uses Amazon Nova Lite to compose an answer, and applies guardrails. PostgreSQL stores) Tj T* (chat history and application records; potentially sensitive actions enter a human-in-the-loop \(HITL\) approval queue. GlassFlow) Tj T* (Rius provides observability for instrumented operations.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
BT /F2 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 45 475.1 Tm (4. Real-World Use Cases) Tj T* ET
q
1 0 0 1 45 339.1 cm
q
BT 1 0 0 1 0 113.8 Tm 12.3 TL /F2 9.2 Tf .121569 .121569 .121569 rg (HR and employee policies:) Tj /F1 9.2 Tf ( Ask about leave entitlement, working hours, remote work, and onboarding rules.) Tj  T*  T* /F2 9.2 Tf (IT and security knowledge:) Tj /F1 9.2 Tf ( Find password, MFA, device security, and incident-reporting procedures.) Tj  T*  T* /F2 9.2 Tf (Operations and travel policies:) Tj /F1 9.2 Tf ( Retrieve reimbursement rules, approval chains, and internal process guidance.) Tj  T*  T* /F2 9.2 Tf (Multi-turn knowledge assistance:) Tj /F1 9.2 Tf ( Ask follow-up questions without repeating the original context.) Tj  T*  T* /F2 9.2 Tf (Controlled administrative requests:) Tj /F1 9.2 Tf ( Route document deletion or policy modification requests for human review before any) Tj T* (separately implemented execution.) Tj T* ET
Q
